ADDITIONAL NOTICE — SCOPE AND THIRD-PARTY RIGHTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is an INDEPENDENT ACADEMIC BEHAVIOURAL MODEL. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or licensed from Analog Devices, Inc.

The architecture it studies is described in:
  R. Bodnar et al., "A 9.3 nV/rtHz 20 b 40 MS/s 94.2 dB DR Signal-Chain
  Friendly Precision SAR Converter", ISSCC 2024, Session 9.8, pp. 182-183.
and in the patents listed in NOTICE. Those publications and patents remain the
property of their respective owners. Nothing in this repository grants any
licence, express or implied, under any patent or other intellectual property
right of any third party.

Parameters marked [DISCLOSED] are transcribed from the published literature.
Parameters marked [FITTED] were chosen so that the model reproduces a published
figure; they are calibration constants, not independent predictions.
Parameters marked [ASSUMED] have no published source and are suitable only for
sensitivity studies. See docs/provenance.md before quoting any number.
